# The music, in LFS.
#
# Scoped to this directory on purpose. The other half tracks fourteen audio
# files as ordinary blobs and they are small; a repository-wide `*.ogg` rule
# would pull those into LFS on their next checkout, which is not this half's
# business. Git reads attributes per directory, so this one reaches only what
# sits under `vuvko_works/game/`.
public/audio/music/** filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
